      {
        "id": 153023,
        "name": "Yak Guardian",
        "username": "Yak_Guardian",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/yak_guardian/{size}/1884_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-13T13:35:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span>… Then one day I was avoiding doing work… </span> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<span>\n</span></blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Some days that's the only way to get anything done&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span>Oh, and I have to say (and I don't think I'm the first to come up with this, but I'll mention it here because it hasn't come up, yet) I refer to Naturalist having all three icons available as \"Platupus Form\". </span> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=12\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Platypus form rocks!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>And mnay Thanks Spiff for the Tracker!</p>",
